### ══════════════════════════════
### MEDAROTS
### ══════════════════════════════

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Crear Medarot
POST http://localhost:8000/medarots/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Metabee",
  "type": "Shooter",
  "medal_type": "Beetle",
  "attack_power": 85.5
}

###

### 2. Crear otro Medarot
POST http://localhost:8000/medarots/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rokusho",
  "type": "Fighter",
  "medal_type": "Stag",
  "attack_power": 90.0
}

###

### 3. Obtener todos los Medarots
GET http://localhost:8000/medarots/
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Obtener Medarot por ID
GET http://localhost:8000/medarots/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Obtener Medarot inexistente (debe retornar 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/medarots/9999
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Actualizar parcialmente un Medarot
PATCH http://localhost:8000/medarots/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attack_power": 95.0
}

###

### 7. Eliminar Medarot (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/medarots/1

###

### ══════════════════════════════
### MEDAFIGHTERS
### ══════════════════════════════

### 8. Crear Medafighter
POST http://localhost:8000/medafighters/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ikki Tenryou",
  "rank": "Intermediate",
  "specialty": "Close Combat",
  "wins": 10
}

###

### 9. Crear otro Medafighter
POST http://localhost:8000/medafighters/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arika Amazake",
  "rank": "Beginner",
  "specialty": "Support",
  "wins": 3
}

###

### 10. Obtener todos los Medafighters
GET http://localhost:8000/medafighters/
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Obtener Medafighter por ID
GET http://localhost:8000/medafighters/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Obtener Medafighter inexistente (debe retornar 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/medafighters/9999
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Actualizar parcialmente un Medafighter
PATCH http://localhost:8000/medafighters/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rank": "Advanced",
  "wins": 15
}

###

### 14. Eliminar Medafighter (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/medafighters/1
